@7121 = ~Inner Search~
@7122 = ~Inner Search

Excluded by: Arcane Research

After discovering his ancestry through Unleash the Beast, the warlord may choose to cultivate his inner power. He now regards his spells as something beyond arcane magic and draws on that power alone to cast them. His gestures still trace runes, but no longer need to be accompanied by long, complex formulas. His spells no longer require a verbal component.~

@7123 = ~Independence from the Weave~
@7124 = ~Independence from the Weave

Requirement: Inner Search

By distancing himself further from conventional arcane magic, the warlord learns to generate magical energy independently of the Weave. He is no longer affected by dead magic, wild magic or miscast magic.~

@7125 = ~Simplified Manipulations~
@7126 = ~Simplified Manipulations

Requirement: Independence from the Weave

Spellcasting has become second nature to the warlord. He learns to shorten the familiar gestures, greatly reducing casting times:
Level 1 and 2 spells: 1 segment
Level 3 and 4 spells: 2 segments
Level 5 and 6 spells: 3 segments
Level 7 and 8 spells: 4 segments
Level 9 spells: 5 segments

This shortened casting technique, which no longer uses verbal components, cannot benefit from other effects that reduce conventional casting times.~

@7127 = ~Arcane Revolution~
@7128 = ~Arcane Revolution

Requirement: Simplified Manipulations

Fully embracing his inner power, the warlord transforms the way he stores magical energy. He no longer needs to memorize spells while resting: magic exists within him. He can cast any of his spells at will, up to four spells per spell level.

Effects that alter memorized spells no longer affect this inner magic. Energy in All and Transformigration therefore become unusable, as do items that increase spell memorization capacity.~
@71286 = ~Level 6 Spells~
@71287 = ~Level 7 Spells~
@71288 = ~Level 8 Spells~
@71289 = ~Level 9 Spells~

